  "description": "Basic built-in tools package of the Agent runtime: calculator (safe Pratt parser, no eval), now/geocode/weather/exchange demos and the builtinTools collection. Demo-friendly defaults; kept out of the core to keep the engine lean (M6 P1 review, P0).",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": {
    "name": "wangzhiyong",
